<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25445" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπαίζω</span></b> , late fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.569
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πέπαιχα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.):— <i>jest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπαίζων</span>”
				<i>in jest,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					2.37
				</span></i>
			 (dub.), <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.6
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιὰ καλῶς
			διαπεπαισμένη</span> a sport well <i>kept up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				769a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>laugh, jest at,</i> c.acc., <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.7.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.18.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.53
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.57O.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> perh. <i>imitate
				playfully,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Σοφοκλῆς] διαπεπαιχὼς τὸν Αἰσχύλου
					ὄγκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.79b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
